      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_APOSTLE_GILLE",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "너무 실망스럽구나, <color=#F7BE45>[단장]</color>.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "失望したぞ、<color=#F7BE45>「団長」</color>。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_LAVISTAR_04_UNIT_S_APOSTLE_GILLE_012.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 12,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_APOSTLE_GILLE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…아니, <color=#F7BE45>[여정]</color>을 마치지 않은 구원자들이란 건… 원래 이게 정상이겠지.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…いや、<color=#F7BE45>「救援の旅」</color>を終えていない状態なら、この程度が関の山か。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_LAVISTAR_04_UNIT_S_APOSTLE_GILLE_013.wav"
    },
    {
